3. LOADER TELEMETRY & WEBHOOK DISCLOSURE
-------------------------------------------------------------------
- Telemetry Logging: The primary loader script (Loader.lua) contains 
  an active Discord Webhook for security and usage tracking.
- Transmitted Data: Executing Loader.lua will log:
    * Roblox Username
    * Total Executions
    * Executor Name / Environment
    * Place ID & Job ID
    * Game Title
- Verification & Proof: If you require evidence or have questions 
  regarding telemetry data, contact manhtien_yt. on Discord.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
4. CLEAN LOADER REQUESTS (NO WEBHOOK)
-------------------------------------------------------------------
- Unmonitored Loader: If you want a version of Loader.lua that operates 
  without Discord Webhook logging, you must request permission directly 
  from manhtien_yt. on Discord.
- No Unauthorized Tampering: Removing or disabling the Webhook in 
  public releases without prior authorization is strictly prohibited.

